    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d342">

                <pb facs="0799" n="757" xml:id="pg757"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">No. 342</seg>
                </opener>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.5/8–151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in Norway
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d342-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-08-01T19:00:00-04:00">August 1, 1951—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>104. Defense and State have been consulting re fulfillment US responsibilities
                    cooperate with Norway in working out NATO
                    defense requirements in response request North Atlantic Regional Planning
                        Group.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d342-f2"/> Discussions here have reached point
                    where we can be ready on relatively short notice send small group technical reps
                    Defense plus State rep to Oslo to explore with officials Nor Fon and Defense
                    Ministries possible ways and means to achieve requirements. Ascertain from Nors
                    suitable time for exploratory talks indicating we are prepared send group of
                    three or four shortly after Aug 15 and wld like see discussions begin about that
                    date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d342-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d342-f1-content">
                <p>Drafted and approved for transmission by Ronhovde; signed
                    for the Secretary by Bonbright. Repeated
                    to London.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d342-f2" n="2" xml:id="d342-f2-content">
                <p>At a meeting of the North Atlantic Treaty Organization Ministers of Defense at
                    Washington in October 1950 a decision was made, and subsequently approved by the
                    North Atlantic Council, to invite the United States and Norway to negotiate an
                    agreement under which North Atlantic Treaty Organization armed forces would be
                    allowed to use facilities in Norway for the defense of Norway and the rest of
                    the North Atlantic Treaty area. The agreement was to implement the North
                    European Regional Planning Group Medium-Term Defense Plan.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
